  "files": [
    {
      "path": "index.html",
      "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\" />\n  <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\" />\n  <title>Offline Pixel Counter</title>\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"style.css\" />\n</head>\n<body>\n  <main class=\"card\" aria-labelledby=\"title\">\n    <h1 id=\"title\" class=\"title\">Pixel Counter</h1>\n    <output id=\"count\" class=\"count\" aria-live=\"polite\" aria-atomic=\"true\">0</output>\n    <div class=\"controls\">\n      <button id=\"decrease\" type=\"button\" class=\"btn\" aria-label=\"Decrease count by one\">-1</button>\n      <button id=\"reset\" type=\"button\" class=\"btn btn-reset\" aria-label=\"Reset count to zero\">Reset</button>\n      <button id=\"increase\" type=\"button\" class=\"btn\" aria-label=\"Increase count by one\">+1</button>\n    </div>\n    <p class=\"hint\">Use the buttons or press Tab then Enter/Space.</p>\n  </main>\n  <script src=\"script.js\"></script>\n</body>\n</html>\n",
      "description": "Main HTML page with card layout, count output, and labeled buttons."
    },
    {
      "path": "style.css",
      "content": ":root {\n  --bg: #1b1f3b;\n  --panel: #2e3560;\n  --accent: #ffcc4d;\n  --accent-dark: #e0a800;\n  --text: #f4f6ff;\n  --shadow: #0d0f22;\n}\n\n* { box-sizing: border-box; }\n\n[hidden] { display: none !important; }\n\nbody {\n  margin: 0;\n  min-height: 100vh;\n  display: flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  justify-content: center;\n  padding: 24px;\n  background: var(--bg);\n  background-image: linear-gradient(45deg, #232a52 25%, transparent 25%, transparent 75%, #232a52 75%),\n    linear-gradient(45deg, #232a52 25%, transparent 25%, transparent 75%, #232a52 75%);\n  background-size: 32px 32px;\n  background-position: 0 0, 16px 16px;\n  font-family: 'Courier New', ui-monospace, monospace;\n  color: var(--text);\n  font-size: 18px;\n}\n\n.card {\n  width: 100%;\n  max-width: 420px;\n  background: var(--panel);\n  border: 4px solid var(--shadow);\n  box-shadow: 8px 8px 0 var(--shadow);\n  padding: 32px 24px;\n  text-align: center;\n}\n\n.title {\n  margin: 0 0 24px;\n  font-size: 22px;\n  letter-spacing: 2px;\n  text-transform: uppercase;\n  color: var(--accent);\n}\n\n.count {\n  display: block;\n  font-size: 72px;\n  font-weight: bold;\n  line-height: 1;\n  padding: 16px 0 24px;\n  color: var(--text);\n  word-break: break-all;\n}\n\n.controls {\n  display: flex;\n  gap: 12px;\n  justify-content: center;\n  flex-wrap: wrap;\n}\n\n.btn {\n  flex: 1 1 96px;\n  min-height: 56px;\n  font-family: inherit;\n  font-size: 20px;\n  font-weight: bold;\n  cursor: pointer;\n  color: var(--shadow);\n  background: var(--accent);\n  border: 3px solid var(--shadow);\n  box-shadow: 4px 4px 0 var(--shadow);\n  transition: transform 0.05s, box-shadow 0.05s, background 0.15s;\n}\n\n.btn:hover { background: var(--accent-dark); }\n\n.btn:focus-visible {\n  outline: 3px solid var(--text);\n  outline-offset: 3px;\n}\n\n.btn:active {\n  transform: translate(4px, 4px);\n  box-shadow: 0 0 0 var(--shadow);\n}\n\n.btn-reset { background: var(--text); }\n.btn-reset:hover { background: #d7dbf5; }\n\n.hint {\n  margin: 24px 0 0;\n  font-size: 16px;\n  color: #b9c0e8;\n}\n\n@media (max-width: 360px) {\n  .count { font-size: 56px; }\n  .btn { flex: 1 1 100%; }\n}\n",
      "description": "Pixel-themed styles with palette, hover/focus/pressed states, and responsive layout."
    },
    {
      "path": "script.js",
      "content": "(function () {\n  'use strict';\n\n  var countEl = document.getElementById('count');\n  var value = 0;\n\n  function render() {\n    countEl.textContent = String(value);\n  }\n\n  document.getElementById('increase').addEventListener('click', function () {\n    value += 1;\n    render();\n  });\n\n  document.getElementById('decrease').addEventListener('click', function () {\n    value -= 1;\n    render();\n  });\n\n  document.getElementById('reset').addEventListener('click', function () {\n    value = 0;\n    render();\n  });\n\n  render();\n})();\n",
      "description": "Counter logic with addEventListener handlers, integer state, and negative support."
    },
    {
      "path": "README.md",
      "content": "# Offline Pixel Counter\n\nA dependency-free, offline pixel-style counter built with HTML, CSS, and plain JavaScript.\n\n## Usage\n\nOpen `index.html` in any modern browser. No build step, server, network, or storage required.\n\n## Controls\n\n- **-1** (`#decrease`): subtract one from the count.\n- **Reset** (`#reset`): set the count back to zero.\n- **+1** (`#increase`): add one to the count.\n\nThe count is shown in the `#count` output element and supports negative integers.\n\n## Keyboard Access\n\nAll buttons are native `<button>` elements with accessible labels. Press `Tab` to move focus and `Enter` or `Space` to activate. Focus rings are visible.\n\n## Files\n\n- `index.html` — structure and controls.\n- `style.css` — pixel palette, layout, and interactive states.\n- `script.js` — counter state and event handlers.\n\n## Notes\n\n- No external assets, imports, or storage.\n- Layout works down to 360px wide.\n",
      "description": "README covering usage, controls, keyboard access, and file overview."
    }
  ]
